      <title>Cognitive grounding improves LLM simulation of collective human behavior</title>
      <link>https://www.nature.com/articles/s43588-026-01080-z</link>
      <content:encoded>
                &lt;p&gt;Nature Computational Science, Published online: 16 November 2026; &lt;a href="https://www.nature.com/articles/s43588-026-01080-z"&gt;doi:10.1038/s43588-026-01080-z&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;The study shows that guiding AI agents with descriptions of how people make decisions in a supply-chain game helps agents reproduce collective human behavior.</content:encoded>
